2026-08-12 12:06:38 TOOL RESULT [rag_search]: {"result": "ok", "matches": [{"score": 0.0741, "content": "# ContextFlow Reference Material ## Runtime roles OpenClaw is the natural-language Agent and Gateway runtime. MTClaw Function Router is the OpenAI-compatible provider layer: it selects a matching tool for a short path, executes the tool wrapper, and may hand unmatched or complex requests to an upstream model. ContextFlow is the local state and workflow runtime behind those tools. It stores session-isolated state, constrains the allowed Agent and tool capabilities, creates rev", "source": {"document_id": "direct-fix-reference", "title": "contextflow_reference", "source_name": "contextflow_reference.md", "chunk_index": 0}}, {"score": 0.0189, "content": "external writes require explicit user confirmation. Desktop archive follows a safe sequence: search, plan, confirm, execute, then undo. A file remains in place before confirmation, and every completed archive operation has an undo record. ## Event-driven workflow When a meeting note arrives in the monitored meeting inbox, ContextFlow records a `document.meeting_notes_imported` event. The state engine can project `meeting_ended`. If the note contains an explicit numeric deadli", "source": {"document_id": "direct-fix-reference", "title": "contextflow_reference", "source_name": "contextflow_reference.md", "chunk_index": 2}}, {"score": 0.0175, "content": "-isolated state, constrains the allowed Agent and tool capabilities, creates reviewable workflow drafts, and records execution audit events. ## Safe execution ContextFlow can automatically read local files, infer a state from a supported event, search local knowledge, and prepare a workflow draft. It does not automatically send mail, modify a calendar, or write into an external task system. Those external writes require explicit user confirmation. Desktop archive follows a sa", "source": {"document_id": "direct-fix-reference", "title": "contextflow_reference", "source_name": "contextflow_reference.md", "chunk_index": 1}}]}
2026-08-12 12:06:40 ASSISTANT: 根据本地文档的检索结果，三者的关系如下：

- **OpenClaw**：自然语言 Agent 与网关运行时（natural-language Agent and Gateway runtime）。
- **MTClaw Function Router**：OpenAI 兼容的 provider 层，负责为短路径选择匹配的工具、执行工具包装器，并可将未匹配或复杂请求交给上游模型处理。
- **ContextFlow**：位于这些工具背后的本地状态与工作流运行时，存储会话隔离的状态、约束允许的 Agent 与工具能力、创建可审查的工作流草稿，并记录执行审计事件。

